<title>USA: J&amp;J says FDA OKs Nasalcrom counter sales.</title>
<headline>J&amp;J says FDA OKs Nasalcrom counter sales.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>McNeil Consumer Products Co, a Johnson &amp; Johnson unit, said Monday that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration cleared its allergy medication Nasalcrom for over-the-counter marketing.</p>
</text>
